NEW FLOWS ONLY: Each new flow is an Auto-launched Flow with no trigger. Use Assignment elements to copy SObject field values into intermediate String variables before using them — do not chain SObject field references directly. Group all elements of the same type together contiguously in the XML — Salesforce's Flow XML schema rejects interleaved element types. All element X coordinates must be 0 or greater.

